  <para style="h">3 Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya gatatu ryanditswe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya gatatu ryanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Jewe umutama w’ishengero,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="3JN 1:1">Ndakwandikiye wewe Gayo, uwo nkunda mu kuri.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Mugenzi nkunda, ndakwipfuriza kugira amagara meza no kuroranirwa mu mubiri, nk’uko umushaha wawe umerewe. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Naranezerewe cane igihe bamwe muri bene Data baza bakambwira ingene uri umwizigirwa kandi ugendera mu kuri. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Nta munezero woza undutira kwumva ko abana banje bagendera mu kuri.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Mugenzi nkunda, werekana ubwizigirwa mu vyo uriko urakorera bene Data, naho ari abanyamahanga kuri wewe. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Na bo bashingiye intahe urukundo rwawe imbere y’ishengero. Ndakwinginze ubandanye ubashigikira mu vyo bakeneye mu buryo bunezereza Imana, <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />kuko bafashe urugendo bakorera izina rya Kristo, kandi ntibemeye gufashwa n’abatizera. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Dutegerezwa kwakira n’umutima mwiza abantu nk’abo kugira ngo dufatanye na bo gukorera ukuri.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Narandikiye ishengero; ariko Diyotirefe, akunda kwishira imbere, ntiyemera ikibanza cacu nk’abarongozi. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ninaza, nzoshira ahabona ivyo ariko arakora, ibibi n’ibinyoma akwiragiriza atuvuga nabi. Uretse ko we ubwiwe yanka kwakira bene Data, ahubwo abuza n’abashaka kubakira, akanabataramura mw’ishengero.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Mugenzi nkunda, ntukigane ibibi, ariko wigane ivyiza. Umuntu wese akora ivyiza ava ku Mana. Umuntu wese akora ibibi ntarabona Imana. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Demetiriyusi avugwa neza na bose, nk’uko ukuri na kwo kumushingira intahe. Natwe tumuvuga neza kandi urazi ko intahe yacu ari iy’ukuri.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Mfise vyinshi nshaka kukubwira, ariko sinshaka kubikwandikira. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Nizeye ko tuzobonana vuba, tukavugana amaso mu yandi.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Amahoro abane na we.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="3JN 1:15" />
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Abakunzi turi kumwe barakuramutsa. Undamukirize abakunzi muri kumwe, umwe wese ku giti ciwe.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>